F.R. 54-B(6) reads as under;
"(6) Where suspension is revoked pending finalisation of the disciplinary or court proceedings, any order passed under sub-rule (1) before the conclusion of the proceedings, against the Government servant, shall be reviewed on its own motion after the conclusion of the proceedings by the authority mentioned in sub-rule (1)
who shall make an order according to the provisions of sub-rule (3) or sub-rule (5) as the case may be."
